  changes are listed in sushi/FORK.md.

sushi/lib/mlx-src, sushi/lib/mlxc-src — MLX and mlx-c (git submodules)
  https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx, https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx-c — MIT License,
